        "excerpt": "def _history_budget(config, seq_len: int, history_len: int) -> int:\n    if history_len <= 0:\n        return 0\n    ratio = getattr(config, \"snapkv_decouple_budget_ratio\", None)\n    if ratio is not None:\n        # Match opensource SnapKVCluster.update_kv, which truncates the ratio budget.\n        budget = int(seq_len * float(ratio))\n    else:\n        budget = int(getattr(config, \"snapkv_decouple_cache_size\", 512))\n    budget = min(max(budget, 0), int(history_len))\n    return budget"
